ther  irregularly outlined  gray white  firm nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm and located 1 3cm medial and inferior to the tumor  The breast parenchyma shows another gray white firm nodule with irregular borders measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm and located 1 2cm lateral and anterior to the tumor  The breast parenchyma of the lower outer quadrant at approximately 4 o clock position shows another ill defined gray white firm nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  The cut surfaces of this nodule show fibrosis  Obvious fibroadenoma is not appreciated  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of admixed fatty tissue and dense pink white fibrous stroma which show several blue domed cysts measuring from REMOVED_DATE up to 0 7cm in greatest dimension  Obvious lymph nodes are not identified  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor  upper central breast  involving upper outer and upper inner quadrants   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with entire nodule medial and inferior to the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with entire gray white firm nodule lateral and anterior to the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gray white firm area at approximately 4 o clock position  lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with fibrosis and cysts  away from the tumor  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   Bergart  REMOVE_MRN    right breast tissue   is a 51 g  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 8cm aggregate of tan red fibrofatty tissue partially surfaced by irregular strips of tan pink skin ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 10 5cm in greatest dimension  Sectioning reveals unremarkable fibrofatty tissue  and representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1   LEFT SENTINEL NODE   CARCINOMA IS NOT IDENTIFIED  AWAIT SENTINEL NODE WORKUP  Final Diagnosis by David C Wilbur