ne binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  30 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 26 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 0cm piece of breast tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm tan yellow circumscribed firm nodule that abuts the inked margin  Representative sections frozen as frozen section  1  and submitted in cassette A  The nodule is submitted in cassettes B through D  and the remaining tissue in cassettes E through G  Resident  ERIN OCHOA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  BREAST  LEFT   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA PRESENT AT THE INKED MARGIN  O R  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robin E  Kirby  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
