stent with previous biopsy sites  Antero inferior to this rubbery mass is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm indurated grey white nodule which is greater than 4cm of the posterior margin and 0 7cm from the rubbery mass  Located antero superior to the rubbery mass is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm grey white to tan yellow indurated nodule which is also greater than 4cm from the posterior margin and 0 8cm from the rubbery mass  Located in the mid inner breast tissue 2 0cm from the posterior margin is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm cavity containing packing material which is consistent with a previous biopsy site  Noted in the mid upper breast tissue is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm indurated area with a silver metal clip which comes to 1 7cm of the posterior margin  Noted in central breast tissue is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm region of hemorrhage which is  3 5cm from the posterior margin  Sectioning of the upper outer quadrant reveals no apparent lymph nodes  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire nodule from upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire rubbery nodule from upper outer quadrant  including closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire indurated nodule antero inferior to rubbery nodule in upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire indurated nodule antero superior to the rubbery nodule in the upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire cavity from mid inner breast tissue with closest posterior margin as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nodule with clip to closest posterior margin from mid upper breast tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of tissue with clip from mid upper breast tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Region of hemorrhage in central breast tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue from upper outer quadrant which may represent lymph nodes  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  LEFT AXILLA SENTIN