eal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm cavity filled with pink to red hemorrhagic material  The cavity is located within the mid portion of the specimen  abuts the anterior aspect  comes to 0 7cm from the inferior aspect  1 2cm from the posterior  2 0cm from the superior and medial and 2 1cm from the lateral margin  The cavity lining is tan pink  smooth and fibrotic  The borders are tan white  fibrotic with focal bright yellow areas  consistent with fat necrosis  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is tan yellow to pink unremarkable fibroadipose tissue with dense rubbery unremarkable fibrous tissue within the lateral aspect and extending to the lateral margin  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes D I  with the closest cavity to anterior margin in cassettes D E and the closest inferior margin to cavity in cassettes F G  Uninvolved fibrous parenchyma along the lateral aspect in cassettes H I  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  FCK                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE RIGHT AXILLA  EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
